(3) hydrostatic requirement (CFG44): P_target/P_cap = g_N/a0 = (r_M/r)^2 >= 1 for r <= r_M; at r = r_M it is exactly 1 -> F(x_M) -> 1 needs x_M >> 1.
    F(r_M) >= 0.50 requires x_M >= 1.00 i.e. g0 reduced by 1.00x relative to F=1/2
    F(r_M) >= 0.90 requires x_M >= 3.00 i.e. g0 reduced by 3.00x relative to F=1/2
    F(r_M) >= 0.99 requires x_M >= 9.95 i.e. g0 reduced by 9.95x relative to F=1/2
